 Millett","x":"As manufacturing resumed mid-year and domestic steel production increased, scrap generation and demand improved significantly in the second half of 2020, culminating in a significant price increase in January '21 of a $100 per gross ton.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"STLD 2021 Q1","e":"stld","d":"2021-04-20","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mark Millett","x":"And they recognize the issues there and I don't think that the 232 tariffs will be unwound in totality.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"STLD 2021 Q2","e":"stld","d":"2021-07-20","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Mark Millett","x":"Regarding the ongoing negotiations between the US and the EU on revoking 232 tariffs, we expect the final agreement will include import surge protections to protect US national security goals.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"STLD 2021 Q2","e":"stld","d":"2021-07-20","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Mark Millett","x":"Section 201 will maintain a sort of barrier, even if the 232 tariffs get eroded.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"STLD 2021 Q3","e":"stld","d":"2021-10-19","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Mark Millett","x":"Regarding the ongoing negotiations between the US and the EU on revoking 232 tariffs, we expect the final agreement will include a steel quota mechanism to protect US national security goals and eliminate import surge risks.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"STLD 2021 Q4","e":"stld","d":"2022-01-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Theresa Wagler","x":"So I think Mark said, it perfectly that we're not seeing a lot of pressure with items that are passed through to the customer.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"STLD 2021 Q4","e":"stld","d":"2022-01-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Mark Millett","x":"We have been impacted a little by our cost and we've been impacted by the zinc cost over the last 12, 18 months moving up, but most of which is passed through -- the hourly cost, which sell is higher at our engineered bar division than any other mill, again, that tends to be passed to the customers.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"STLD 2022 Q1","e":"stld","d":"2022-04-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Mark Millett","x":"Additionally, given the historically high spread between prime and obsolete grades which is around $170 a ton today, the reduced prime scrap requirement has provided a significant cost savings.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"STLD 2022 Q3","e":"stld","d":"2022-10-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Mark Millett","x":"The investments will be centered though on streamlining and improving our existing operations, lowering our cost structure throughout that organization.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"STLD 2023 Q1","e":"stld","d":"2023-04-20","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Tristan Gresser","x":"So the price increase we've seen has not been reflected at all.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"STLD 2023 Q1","e":"stld","d":"2023-04-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Theresa Wagler","x":"We still expect to have some working capital give back as we head into the second quarter, as we kind of still right size some of our inventory levels, et cetera.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"STLD 2023 Q2","e":"stld","d":"2023-07-20","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Theresa Wagler","x":"In the last several years, they have had domestically the consumers of aluminum sheet actually had to import about 20% of their needs, and that had high tariffs associated with that imported costs.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"STLD 2023 Q3","e":"stld","d":"2023-10-19","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Bill Peterson","x":"Maybe looking at removing some of the tariffs or adjusting quotas and things like that.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"STLD 2023 Q3","e":"stld","d":"2023-10-19","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Mark Millett","x":"That said, obviously the tariffs today, a lot of that has been negotiated away in only probably 25% or so of incoming, steel imports are affected by that.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"STLD 2023 Q4","e":"stld","d":"2024-01-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Theresa Wagler","x":"So you're going to see some of that incremental price hike in the first quarter but you would have seen some of it in the fourth quarter as well.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"STLD 2023 Q4","e":"stld","d":"2024-01-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Timna Tanners","x":"That's actually really helpful, but I was asking about fabrication and the throughput of flat-rolled price increases and the impact on margins on downstream.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"STLD 2024 Q1","e":"stld","d":"2024-04-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Barry Schneider","x":"So we have a great position to lead into these kind of tariffs.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"STLD 2024 Q1","e":"stld","d":"2024-04-24","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Tristan Gresser","x":"And there have been some discussion at the high level between the U.S. and Europe of potential carbon-based tariffs.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"STLD 2024 Q2","e":"stld","d":"2024-07-18","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Alex Hacking","x":"Are you concerned that some of the rhetoric that's sprung up recently could lead to more tariffs, retaliatory tariffs.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"STLD 2024 Q2","e":"stld","d":"2024-07-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Mark Millett","x":"The labor, which makes up, in our mind, about 35% of the differential, we will have a reduced workforce.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"STLD 2024 Q3","e":"stld","d":"2024-10-17","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mark Millett","x":"And if there truly was less damage for some of those countries, the final tariff amounts will reflect that.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"STLD 2024 Q3","e":"stld","d":"2024-10-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark Millett","x":"Labor, we should have a reduced workforce of perhaps 700 to 750 people versus perhaps 1,200 or more in a conventional facility of this size.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"STLD 2024 Q4","e":"stld","d":"2025-01-23","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Tristan Gresser","x":"Is that because there were signs that the tariffs may not be applied in full?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"STLD 2024 Q4","e":"stld","d":"2025-01-23","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Tristan Gresser","x":"And also regarding the import situation, obviously there's a lot of chatter around potential tariffs.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"STLD 2025 Q1","e":"stld","d":"2025-04-23","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Barry Schneider","x":"This along with the announced 232 tariffs should positively impact demand for lower carbon emission US-produced steel products.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"STLD 2025 Q1","e":"stld","d":"2025-04-23","l":"tariffs","r"